# gnuboy on the WHY2025 badge: what the keypad does (sdapps/README.md).
# The symbol keys reach Linux as F1..F6: f1 = square, f2 = triangle,
# f3 = cross, f4 = circle, f5 = cloud, f6 = diamond.

bind esc quit
bind up +up
bind down +down
bind left +left
bind right +right
bind f4 +a
bind f3 +b
bind x +a
bind z +b
bind enter +start
bind space +select
bind backspace +select
bind f1 savestate
bind f2 loadstate
